@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "BitcoinPriceDownloader" {
  +fetch_bitcoin_market_data()
  +fetch_bitcoin_hourly_market_data()
  +build_price_dataframe()
  +save_raw_data()
}

class "GetXAPITweetDownloader" {
  +read_price_date_range()
  +fetch_tweets_for_query()
  +download_tweets_for_date_range()
  +save_tweets()
}

class "TweetTextCleaner" {
  +clean_tweet_text()
  +clean_tweet_file()
}

class "TweetColumnTrimmer" {
  +trim_tweet_columns()
}

class "EngagementWeightBuilder" {
  +calculate_engagement_score()
  +calculate_engagement_weight()
  +create_tweet_engagement_weights()
}

class "ModelDatasetBuilder" {
  +build_price_features()
  +build_sentiment_features()
  +add_leakage_safe_features()
  +build_final_dataset()
  +validate_final_dataset()
}

class "ModelComparisonTrainer" {
  +chronological_split()
  +train_logistic_regression()
  +train_random_forest()
  +train_gradient_boosting()
  +train_svm()
  +evaluate_predictions()
  +run_model_comparison()
}

class "ModelResultPlotter" {
  +plot_metric_comparison()
  +plot_feature_set_auc()
  +plot_model_heatmap()
  +plot_confusion_matrices()
}

class "ModelReportApp" {
  +_start_training()
  +_run_training_pipeline()
  +_show_report_screen()
  +_display_figure()
}

BitcoinPriceDownloader --> ModelDatasetBuilder : fiyat verisi
GetXAPITweetDownloader --> TweetColumnTrimmer : ham tweet
TweetColumnTrimmer --> TweetTextCleaner : azaltılmış kolonlar
TweetTextCleaner --> EngagementWeightBuilder : temiz metin
EngagementWeightBuilder --> ModelDatasetBuilder : engagement_weight
ModelDatasetBuilder --> ModelComparisonTrainer : final_dataset.csv
ModelComparisonTrainer --> ModelResultPlotter : model_results.csv
ModelComparisonTrainer --> ModelResultPlotter : confusion_matrices.json
ModelReportApp --> ModelDatasetBuilder : pipeline çalıştırır
ModelReportApp --> ModelComparisonTrainer : pipeline çalıştırır
ModelReportApp --> ModelResultPlotter : grafik üretir
ModelReportApp --> ModelResultPlotter : PNG görüntüler
@enduml
